{
  "__comment": [
    "Slay Idle Repeat — 'Telemetry pipeline' dashboard (M0-03).",
    "",
    "This dashboard is about the PIPELINE, not the game. Until M5-11 registers the",
    "OpenTelemetry SDK in SlayIdleRepeat.Server, the application emits nothing, so",
    "a dashboard of game metrics would be eight empty panels and no way to tell an",
    "empty panel from a broken collector.",
    "",
    "What it shows instead: whether every scrape target is up, whether the",
    "collector is accepting spans and metrics, and whether it is successfully",
    "handing them on to Jaeger. That answers the only question worth asking today",
    "— 'is the road built?' — and it stays useful afterwards, because it is the",
    "first place to look when M5-11's instrumentation appears to produce nothing.",
    "",
    "Game dashboards (10.1's event set, perk pick rate, run abandonment) belong to",
    "M5-11 and later, as separate files in this directory."
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**The telemetry road, not the traffic.** `SlayIdleRepeat.Server` emits no spans or metrics until **M5-11** — the series below are the OpenTelemetry Collector's own self-telemetry (`otelcol_*`, scraped from `otel-collector:8888`) plus scrape health.\n\nIf *Scrape targets up* is all-green and *Spans accepted* moves when you send a test span, the pipeline works and any missing application data is the application's doing.\n\nSend a test span (from the repo root):\n\n```\ncurl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:4318/v1/traces -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d @infra/otel-collector/testdata/span.json\n```\n\nThen look for service `sir-pipeline-probe` in Jaeger at http://127.0.0.1:16686."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scrape targets up",
      "description": "1 = Prometheus can reach the target. otel-collector-app is expected to be up with zero series until M5-11.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 1,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
          "expr": "up",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green", "index": 1 } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Collector uptime",
      "description": "otelcol_process_uptime_seconds — resets to 0 whenever the collector restarts.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 4 },
      "id": 2,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
          "expr": "otelcol_process_uptime_seconds_total or otelcol_process_uptime_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "uptime",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Collector memory (RSS)",
      "description": "otelcol_process_memory_rss_bytes. The memory_limiter processor is configured at 300 MiB in infra/otel-collector/config.yaml. (Metric names come from the collector's own telemetry and have changed between releases — the `or` in the query tolerates both spellings.)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 4 },
      "id": 3,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
          "expr": "otelcol_process_memory_rss_bytes or otelcol_process_resident_memory_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "rss",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 314572800 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spans: accepted by the receiver vs sent to Jaeger",
      "description": "Flat at zero until something sends a span. A gap between the two lines means the exporter is failing — check `docker compose logs otel-collector`.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "id": 4,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "accepted (otlp receiver)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_sent_spans_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "sent (-> jaeger)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "FAILED"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "FAILED" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "none" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Metric points: accepted vs exported to Prometheus",
      "description": "The metrics half of the same pipeline. Populated by M5-11.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 10 },
      "id": 5,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_metric_points_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "accepted (otlp receiver)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_sent_metric_points_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "exported (-> :8889)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "slayidlerepeat-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_processor_refused_metric_points_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "REFUSED (memory_limiter)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "REFUSED (memory_limiter)" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "none" }
      }
    }
  ],
  "preload": false,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["slay-idle-repeat", "infrastructure", "m0-03"],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "utc",
  "title": "Telemetry pipeline (collector self-telemetry)",
  "uid": "sir-telemetry-pipeline",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
